1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,680
It's try on time my favorite part I have a lot so be prepared.
到试穿时间了，我最喜欢的环节！东西挺多，准备好哦。

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:10,200
The first thing was a success this sweater I don't know what it is about it I think just the fit of it and the crop of it I really like.
第一件就很成功。这件毛衣说不上具体哪里好，可能是合身度和短版长度，我很喜欢。

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,800
It reminds me a bit of a school girl uniform randomly.
不知道为什么，它有点让我想到女学生制服。

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:22,320
This next top I was disappointed in the fit of it just was not flattering on me and it was really really cropped which I don't know something about this was just I didn't like.
下一件上衣我挺失望，穿在身上不太衬我，而且真的很短，总有点说不出的不喜欢。

5
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:31,200
The Brandy sweater I was also a bit disappointed in it just made me look like I was wearing a towel it had no shape or form whatsoever I felt like I was drowning in it.
Brandy 那件毛衣也让我有点失望，看起来像围着一条毛巾，完全没有线条，整个人都像被淹没了。

6
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:38,279
This next sweater I did like the color of it but it was just all right it was nice but I didn't love it.
下一件毛衣的颜色我喜欢，不过整体就还行，好看归好看，没有特别心动。

7
00:00:38,279 --> 00:00:43,200
This sweater actually watching this back makes me sad that I didn't buy it I don't know why I didn't.
这件毛衣现在回看，倒让我有点后悔没买，也不知道当时为什么没买。

8
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:53,040
And you guys know a jersey was on my list this one I drowned in it was much too big for me I knew it was going to be too big for me but I had false hopes.
你们知道，球衣也在我的清单里。但这件实在太大，我都被它吞没了。其实我知道会大，还是抱了点不切实际的希望。

9
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:59,040
Okay guys I'm in my pjs and I'm back home so you know what that means it's haul time.
好啦，我穿上睡衣回家了，所以你们知道接下来是什么——购物收获分享！

10
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:03,200
I decided to bring my own bag when I was thrifting so I put everything in here.
我决定逛旧衣店时自己带个袋子，所以东西都装在这里了。

11
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:10,399
I was thrifting for I think 4 hours today so I didn't get that much stuff because I'm very selective now I'm very picky.
我今天大概逛了四小时，但没买太多，因为现在挑东西很谨慎，挺挑剔的。

12
00:01:10,399 --> 00:01:18,960
I used to be not picky I bought anything like I bought the crystal to kera t shirt now I'm trying to be more minimalistic with my wardrobe so I was selective.
以前我不怎么挑，什么都买，比如那件印花 T 恤。现在想让衣橱更精简，所以会有选择地买。

13
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:26,879
That being said the first thing I got is this this is wait I think my friends from college would really like this and think it's funny.
不过话说回来，我买的第一件是这个——等等，我觉得大学朋友们应该会喜欢，也会觉得好笑。

14
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:29,719
Um it's just a cute little t shirt I think I'm going to use this to sleep at night.
这就是一件可爱的小 T 恤，我想可能会拿它当睡衣。

15
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:37,760
It's a little kitten and it says I don't do mornings I actually do do mornings now cuz I'm changed person but I still like this.
上面有只小猫，写着“我不适合早晨”。其实我现在已经能早起了，变了个人，不过还是喜欢它。

16
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:49,749
Like I said earlier the big thing is that there is a huge distinction between thrift stores and vintage stores especially in new York there's a ton of vintage stores but they're advertised as thrift stores when they're not even that inexpensive.
像前面说的，二手店和古着店差别很大，特别在纽约，很多古着店标榜是二手店，实际上也没那么便宜。

17
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:58,360
This was 20 which is actually crazy this is not thrifting to me it's just too expensive but I did really like it so I bought it anyways.
这件要二十块，我觉得真夸张，对我来说不算淘便宜二手货，太贵了。不过确实喜欢，所以还是买了。

18
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:05,560
Sticking with the same store this was the first store I went to the only clothing piece I got was this t shirt but I did get some other fun things.
仍然说第一家店，我在那里买的衣服只有这件 T 恤，不过还买了些有趣的小东西。

19
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:17,040
When I was there they had a matchbox selection and since I moved to new York last year something I've been doing is collecting matchboxes from places that I go and it was just so fun to go through and pick out my favorite.
店里有不少火柴盒。自从去年搬到纽约，我就在收集自己去过的地方的火柴盒，翻着挑喜欢的很有意思。

20
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:23,000
They also had as you guys probably saw a big collection of hair clips it was on this dresser it was really cute set up.
你们可能也看到了，他们有很多发夹，就摆在那个梳妆台上，陈列得很可爱。

21
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:28,600
So I got this tortoise shell hair clip I thought it was really cute I think this was four 3 or 4.
所以我买了这个玳瑁纹发夹，觉得很可爱，好像三四块吧。

22
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:39,240
And then they had these earrings which I loved because you guys know I love jewelry and I've not seen something quite like this before and I like the brown almost marble look to it.
我还很喜欢这副耳环。你们知道我爱首饰，而且之前没见过太像的款式，这种棕色近似大理石的纹样很好看。

23
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:42,910
I'm going to wash them before I put them on but I just want to see how they look right now.
戴之前我会洗一下，不过现在先看看上耳效果。

24
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:49,600
Ooh they're going to be fun with the right outfit I think I would have to wear brown with this I love just like an all brown look.
噢，配对衣服应该很有意思。我觉得要搭棕色，我很喜欢全身棕色的感觉。

25
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:57,240
I'm really excited about these and I asked them I was like where do you guys source your jewelry because these are so cool and they said they have this vintage vendor that was really cool.
我很期待戴它们。我还问店员，首饰从哪里进货，因为实在很酷；他们说有位做古着的供货商。

26
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,800
That's all I got from the first place.
以上就是我在第一家店买的全部东西。

27
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:04,639
I do want to say though that is my favorite vintage store I've been to in new York even though it probably doesn't look like it.
不过我想强调，这确实是我在纽约去过最喜欢的一家古着店，即使买到的东西看起来没那么多。

28
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:10,199
Cuz I didn't get more clothes it's because the things that I liked didn't fit me and they didn't have my size and the things that I liked.
没买更多衣服，是因为喜欢的款式不合身，也没有合适的尺码。

29
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:21,000
So I don't know if it was just the day like just like an off day sizing for me there but I'm definitely going to go back because they had really cool cool stuff even just accessory wise it was really cool.
所以不知道是不是刚好那天尺码都不合适，但我肯定还会回去。东西真的很酷，就算只看配饰也很值得。
